  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "One day before receiving a massive sum of 19.5 billion won, the protagonist, An Ji-Heon, is murdered by hitmen. When he opens his eyes again, he instinctively realizes that something he’s only ever seen in movies is happening to him. \n\nA time travel journey that goes backward one day at a time! When he wakes up, it’s not tomorrow—it’s yesterday. But the novelty wears off quickly. With 19.5 billion won just within reach, Ji-Heon, who finds himself drifting further away from it with each passing day, resolves to escape this phenomenon by any means necessary, regardless of whether it’s time travel or not. \n\n*“I can’t just sit here and turn into a newborn baby. I’m getting my 19.5 billion won back, no matter what!!”*\n\nThe protagonist, An Ji-Heon’s, blood, sweat, and tears-filled journey to escape ‘The Minus’ begins.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
